		"ja": [
			"『ガンダムビルドダイバーズ』に登場する新機体「ジェガンブラストマスター」がキット化！",
			"• 肩部、脚部のビーム砲は展開可能なほか、特徴的な背部の武装はパネルの展開、砲身の伸縮、グリップの展開など様々なギミックを搭載！",
			"• さらにバックパックはパーツ差し替えで、一部HGシリーズにも装備可能！"
		],
		"en": [
			"The new aircraft \"Jegan Blast Master\" appearing in \"Gundam Build Divers\" is now a kit!",
			"• In addition to the beam cannons on the shoulders and legs that can be deployed, the distinctive armament on the back is equipped with various gimmicks such as panel deployment, gun barrel extension and contraction, and grip deployment!",
			"• In addition, the backpack can be equipped on some HG series by replacing parts!"
		]
